# API Service Scenario Rules

- OpenAPI 3.x spec in `api/openapi.yaml` — generate server stubs from it
- Health endpoints: `GET /healthz` (always 200), `GET /readyz` (dependency check)
- Middleware order: logging → recovery → CORS → auth → rate limit → request validation
- All mutations: accept and validate `Idempotency-Key` header
- Rate limit: per-IP (unauthenticated) and per-user (authenticated)
- Structured JSON logging with request ID and trace ID
- Graceful shutdown: SIGTERM → drain connections → finish in-flight → exit
- Tests: unit + integration (with testcontainers or in-memory DB)